abstract: >-
  Hierarchy-aware, time-aware memory for LLM agents and retrieval-augmented
  generation on hyperbolic (Poincaré ball) geometry. Official open-source
  reference implementation of the geometry-aware memory component of
  "LLM Orchestration with Geometry-Aware Memory" (IEEE ICBDML 2026).
keywords:
  - large language models
  - agent memory
  - hyperbolic embeddings
  - Poincaré ball
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - hierarchical retrieval
